{"id":"f85bd57585257521","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-cummings.md","title":"Cummings Successor Tower","display":"df-cummings — Cummings Successor Tower","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cummings","aliases":["58-df-cummings"],"display":"df-cummings — Cummings Successor Tower","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cummings"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cummings</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cummings — Cummings Successor Tower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2079cb7dec7ca43\" href=\"?note=b2079cb7dec7ca43\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\theta\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\theta\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in V\">\\(\\delta\\in V\\)</span> (set-sized ordinal length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in V\">\\(C\\in V\\)</span> (sequence candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (ordinal predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\mu)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> is the successor cardinal of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b2079cb7dec7ca43\" href=\"?note=b2079cb7dec7ca43\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaSuccessor}(\\kappa,\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{OmegaSuccessor}(\\kappa,\\theta)\\)</span> (the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-fold successor-cardinal relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CummingsSequence}(C,\\kappa,\\delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{CummingsSequence}(C,\\kappa,\\delta)\\)</span> (set-sized continuous tower predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cummings\\text{-}omega\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\operatorname{OmegaSuccessor}(\\kappa,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\exists s\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\omega\\land s(0)=\\kappa\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(s(n))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(s(n+1),s(n))\\land\\theta=\\sup\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cummings\\text{-}omega\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\operatorname{OmegaSuccessor}(\\kappa,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\exists s\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\omega\\land s(0)=\\kappa\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(s(n))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(s(n+1),s(n))\\land\\theta=\\sup\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cummings} \\vdash \\operatorname{CummingsSequence}(C,\\kappa,\\delta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(C)=\\delta+1\\land C(0)=\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\leq\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(C(\\alpha))\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\;\\operatorname{OmegaSuccessor}(C(\\alpha),C(\\alpha+1))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\leq\\delta\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to C(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}C(\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cummings} \\vdash \\operatorname{CummingsSequence}(C,\\kappa,\\delta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(C)=\\delta+1\\land C(0)=\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\leq\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(C(\\alpha))\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\;\\operatorname{OmegaSuccessor}(C(\\alpha),C(\\alpha+1))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\leq\\delta\\;(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to C(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}C(\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The original class-function expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}^{\\mathrm{Ord}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}^{\\mathrm{Ord}}\\)</span> is not a set in ZFC; the repaired predicate therefore constrains the graph of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> by its set-sized domain instead of using <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as a codomain.</li>\n<li>“Cummings” is retained as this knowledge graph's local label. The mechanism formalized here is a continuous transfinite iteration of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-fold successor-cardinal operation; the finite successor tower is represented by the witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>, so no unregistered <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^{+n}\">\\(\\kappa^{+n}\\)</span> operator is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","loca